<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<section xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="fs-id1170655150800" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID"><title>Ayo Nganggo Variabel lan Tandha Aljabar</title><para id="fs-id1170654957085">Apa bedane frasa lan ukara? Frasa kuwi ngandharake siji gagasan sing durung pepak yen madeg dhewe. Ukara ngandharake sawijining bab kanthi pepak. Iki padanan basa Jawa saka tuladha ing sumber basa Indonesia: “Mlayu banter banget” kuwi frasa, nanging “Wong sing dolanan bal-balan kuwi mlayu banter banget” kuwi ukara. Ing tuladha iki, ukara duwe subjek lan predikat. Ing aljabar, ana <emphasis effect="italics">wujud aljabar</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">persamaan</emphasis>.</para>
<note id="fs-id1170655102379">
<title>Wujud Aljabar</title>
<para id="fs-id1170654958000"><term id="term-00012">Wujud Aljabar</term> kuwi wilangan, variabel, utawa gabungan wilangan lan variabel sing nganggo tandha operasi.</para>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170654988522"><emphasis effect="bold">Wujud Aljabar</emphasis> kuwi mèmper karo frasa ing basa Indonesia. Iki sawetara tuladha wujud aljabar lan padanan tembung-tembunge ing basa Jawa:</para>
<table id="fs-id1170655221887" class="unnumbered" aria-label="Tabel iki ana telung kolom lan limang larik. Larik paling ndhuwur isine judhul kolom. Kolom kapisan tulisane “Wujud Aljabar”, kolom kapindho “Tembung-tembung”, lan kolom katelu “Padanan Frasa Basa Indonesia”. Ing kolom “Wujud Aljabar” ana: 3, tandha tambah, 5; n, tandha kurang, 1; 6, tandha titik ping-pingan, 7; x ing ndhuwur garis pecahan lan y ing ngisor garis pecahan. Ing kolom “Tembung-tembung” ana: “3 ditambah lima”, “n dikurangi siji”, “6 ping 7”, lan “x dipara y”. Ing kolom “Padanan Frasa Basa Indonesia” ana padanan basa Jawa: “gunggung telu lan lima”, “selisih n lan siji”, “asil ping-pingan enem lan pitu”, lan “asil paran x lan y”.">
<label />
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
<colspec colnum="3" colname="c3" />
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Wujud Aljabar</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Tembung-tembung</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Padanan Frasa Basa Indonesia</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">3 ditambah 5</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">gunggung telu lan lima</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>n</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">n</emphasis> dikurangi siji</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">selisih <emphasis effect="italics">n</emphasis> lan siji</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">6 ping 7</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">asil ping-pingan enem lan pitu</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>y</m:mi></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> dipara <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">asil paran <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis></entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<para id="fs-id1170655003585">Ing sumber basa Indonesia, frasa-frasa sing wis dipadhakake ing tabel mau durung dadi ukara sing pepak amarga ora duwe predikat.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170654938230"><emphasis effect="bold">Persamaan</emphasis> kuwi dumadi saka rong wujud aljabar sing digandhengake nganggo <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00013">tandha padha karo</term>. Yen tandha-tandha ing persamaan diwaca nganggo tembung-tembung, ing sumber basa Indonesia dadi ukara sing pepak. Ing pepadhan iki, tandha padha karo dadi predikate. Ing ngisor iki ana padanan basa Jawane.</para>
<note id="fs-id1170655118064">
<title>Persamaan</title>
<para id="fs-id1170655170220"><term id="term-00014">Persamaan</term> kuwi rong wujud aljabar sing digandhengake nganggo tandha padha karo.</para>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170655111405">Iki sawetara tuladha persamaan.</para>
<table id="fs-id1170655090988" class="unnumbered" aria-label="Tabel iki ana rong kolom lan nem larik. Larik paling ndhuwur isine judhul kolom. Kolom kapisan tulisane “Persamaan” lan kolom kapindho “Padanan Ukara Basa Indonesia”. Ing kolom “Persamaan” ana: 3, tandha tambah, 5, tandha padha karo, 8; n, tandha kurang, 1, tandha padha karo, 14; 6, tandha titik ping-pingan, 7, tandha padha karo, 42; x, tandha padha karo, 53; y, tandha tambah, 9, tandha padha karo, 2, y, tandha kurang, 3. Ing kolom “Padanan Ukara Basa Indonesia” ana padanan basa Jawa: “Gunggung telu lan lima padha karo wolu”, “n dikurangi siji padha karo patbelas”, “Asil ping-pingan enem lan pitu padha karo patang puluh loro”, “x padha karo sèket telu”, lan “y ditambah sanga padha karo loro y dikurangi telu”.">
<label />
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Persamaan</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Padanan Ukara Basa Indonesia</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Gunggung telu lan lima padha karo wolu.</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>n</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">n</emphasis> dikurangi siji padha karo patbelas.</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>42</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Asil ping-pingan enem lan pitu padha karo patang puluh loro.</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>53</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> padha karo sèket telu.</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> ditambah sanga padha karo loro <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> dikurangi telu.</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<example id="fs-id1170654953357"><exercise id="fs-id1170654953360">
<problem id="fs-id1170655229951">
<para id="fs-id1170655162511">Saben wujud ing ngisor iki kalebu wujud aljabar utawa persamaan? Temtokna:</para>
<para id="fs-id1170655153999"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>40</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655111791">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>
<table id="eip-10" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Tabel iki nuduhake bedane wujud aljabar lan persamaan, karo tuladha lan katrangan kanggo saben jinis.">
<tgroup cols="2"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:math></entry>
    <entry>Iki kuwi <emphasis effect="italics">persamaan</emphasis>—rong wujud aljabar digandhengake nganggo tandha padha karo.</entry>
  </row>

<row>
    <entry><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math></entry>
    <entry>Iki kuwi <emphasis effect="italics">wujud aljabar</emphasis>—ora ana tandha padha karo.</entry>
  </row>

<row>
    <entry><span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:math></entry>
   <entry>Iki kuwi <emphasis effect="italics">wujud aljabar</emphasis>—ora ana tandha padha karo.</entry>
  </row>

<row>
    <entry><span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>40</m:mn></m:math></entry>
    <entry>Iki kuwi <emphasis effect="italics">persamaan</emphasis>—rong wujud aljabar digandhengake nganggo tandha padha karo.</entry>
  </row>
</tbody>



</tgroup>
</table></solution>
</exercise>
</example><note id="fs-id1170655166808" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654924234">
<problem id="fs-id1170654924237">
<para id="fs-id1170655124883">Saben wujud ing ngisor iki kalebu wujud aljabar utawa persamaan? Temtokna: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>27</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655226888">
<para id="fs-id1170655120617"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> persamaan <span class="token">ⓑ</span> wujud aljabar</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170655205588" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655022136">
<problem id="fs-id1170655027224">
<para id="fs-id1170655027226">Saben wujud ing ngisor iki kalebu wujud aljabar utawa persamaan? Temtokna: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>22</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654959582">
<para id="fs-id1170654959584"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> wujud aljabar <span class="token">ⓑ</span> persamaan</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
</section>
